    "Description": "A transparency slide showing the right side saddle and hind quarter of a carousel pig. Large portions of the skin and the saddle blanket are black. The saddle is brown and the saddle blanket is green with yellow detailing, and a red border. The tack is red with some brown clasp details. The pig is very well worn. The image has very fine black spots on it. The slide reads “PULLEN PARK CAROUSEL PULLEN PARK 16B RIGHT READ/MID” at the top and “Pig RALEIGH NC WAKE CO RR RALEIGH FINES ARTS SOCIETY” at the bottom.",
